								Cannot be swung in a stomach which has less than {BroadswordSwingCapacityMin} max capacity.
								When successfully swung in a stomach, [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DealDamage}:deals struggle damage] instead.
								Effectiveness is reduced if not done to the beat of the current pred's struggle chart.
								''' */
							// Flavor: A simple sword fashioned from oak wood, and tasting about the same.
						}
					}

