							[c/7F7F7F:> ][c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Makes your stomach weightless, no matter what or who is in it.]
							[c/7F7F7F:> ][c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Grants infinite swallow and stomach capacity, and makes it impossible for prey to escape your stomach unless you regurgitate them.]
							[c/7F7F7F:> ][c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Grants the ability to eat bosses regardless of whether your currently-selected gear and abilities would allow you to.]
							[c/7F7F7F:> ][c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Raises your acid tier to MILES beyond the maximum.]
							[c/7F7F7F:> ][c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Increases digestion tick rate by a factor of 4.]
							[c/7F7F7F:> ][c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Increases absorption rate by a factor of 8.]
							Several item effects and UI elements will be modified while this item or any of its counterparts are equipped.
							''' */
						/* Flavor:
							'''
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:this is a prefabricated copy of Rose's personal flower hairpin]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:it's not where any of her more				egregious predatory abilities come from]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:she is naturally just that much a glutton. ate an entire mountain range as a snack once]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:she tells people that this flower was the very last thing left from the last world she ate]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:she doesn't tell them that I made it for her when I made her]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:I made a virtually-infinite number of 'em so that if she accidentally ate it]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:(and she has, more times than I care to count)]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:she'd have another rarin' to go shortly thereafter to keep her happy]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:she tells me these flowers are delicious]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:then again, she thinks everything's delicious, so maybe take her word with a grain of salt]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:don't try to eat it. she'll know, and she'll make you a meal]
							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:no matter how strong you are or how invincible you think you are]

							[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.ThomasCommentary}:after all, she REALLY likes the taste of these flowers]
							''' */
					}

