								The [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:Wet] debuff and [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:Honey] buff count for this accessory.
								[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Increases digestion damage] by [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:{Stat}%].
								[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Increases prey absorption rate] by [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:{Stat}%].
								[c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveEffect}:Decreases damage taken] by [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:{Endu}%].
								When eaten:
								- [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Increases digestion damage] by [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:{Perm}%].
								- [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.PositiveVoreEffect}:Increases prey absorption rate] by [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.DoSomething}:{Perm}%].
								This bonus only applies once. Eating this item after you have already done so [c/{$Mods.V2.CommonColorCodes.NegativeEffect}:will have no further effect].
